# detect of an Uno without a manifest: connect-uno, then STK_LEAVE_PROGMODE
# Arduino Uno R3 (ATmega16U2, Optiboot at 115200): DTR pulse, sync, signature
! identity 2341:0043
! baud 115200
! signals dtr=0 rts=0
! sleep 250
! signals dtr=1 rts=1
! sleep 50
> 30 20
< 14 10
> 75 20
< 14 1e 95 0f 10
> 51 20
< 14 10
